## Why This Is Asked

This probes end-to-end exactly-once semantics across HTTP, DB, and Kafka, using the Outbox pattern, transactional producers, and deduplication strategies. It also evaluates testing under peak load with retries.

## Key Concepts

- Outbox pattern
- Kafka transactions and idempotence
- Unique constraints for dedupe
- read_committed vs transactional reads
- End-to-end verification under load

## Code Example

