## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to coordinate cross-service schema evolution with zero downtime and measurable rollback.

## Key Concepts

- Schema evolution compatibility (backward/forward)
- Canary rollout and feature-flag control
- Atomicity across DB write and Kafka publish
- Cache refresh and cache invalidation in Redis
- Search index propagation
- Observability and rollback criteria

